id: gigantification
name: Gigantification
uaType: both
prerequisite: Spirit Control
tpCost: 10
type: standard
actionCost: 1
kiCostPerTier: 4
# "You may increase your Size Category to any Size Category up to Gigantic. If you do, you must pay the Ki Point Cost of this
# Unique Ability at the start of each of your turns" - the Size asked as it is used, Shapeshift's way (any but Colossal); its upkeep as any
# Sustained one's.
sustained: true
shapeshift: true
source: Spirit Control
description: >
  Grow to any Size Category up to Gigantic, paying its Ki Point Cost each turn. Passive: the Giant Form Enhancement; any Size
  Category but Colossal outside of Combat Encounters.
text: >
  Gigantification: You grow to whatever size you desire.
  –Ability Type: Technical/Magical
  –Prerequisites: Spirit Control
  –TP Cost: 10
  –KP Cost: 4(T)
  –Maneuver Type: Standard
  –Action Cost: 1 Action
  –Minions: N/A
  –Passive Bonus: You gain access to the Giant Form Enhancement, and may be any Size Category (except Colossal) you wish outside of Combat Encounters.
  –Effect: You may increase your Size Category to any Size Category up to Gigantic. If you do, you must pay the Ki Point Cost of this Unique Ability at the start of each of your turns. If you do not, stop applying this effect. You may also stop applying this effect as an Instant Maneuver.

---

# Its Passive's Giant Form: added from the Transformations tab - the table's, as every access to a Transformation is.
